```Title: AWS VPC Traffic Mirroring Configured (AWS CloudTrail)```
```ATT&CK: T1020.001 | Severity: medium | Sigma id: 34eea066-cf25-4cab-8fa4-ff798ca2a91e```
```Data source: AWS CloudTrail (Splunk Add-on for AWS). Change index to where your CloudTrail data lives.```
```False positives: Network or security teams configuring traffic mirroring for monitoring```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity medium.```
index=aws sourcetype="aws:cloudtrail"
(eventSource="ec2.amazonaws.com" eventName IN ("CreateTrafficMirrorSession", "CreateTrafficMirrorTarget", "CreateTrafficMirrorFilter", "CreateTrafficMirrorFilterRule"))
| table _time eventSource eventName userIdentity.arn sourceIPAddress awsRegion errorCode
